---
title: Nodes
description: "Effects, meters and control nodes in Splitwave: dynamics, EQ, noise removal, loudness metering and push to talk."
order: 2
---

Effects sit between an input and an output and change the audio that passes through them. Every effect has an **On** switch in its header that bypasses it, and big effects can collapse to a single summary row with the chevron next to it.

## Dynamics

Dynamics effects react to how loud the signal is.

- **[Compressor](/wiki/nodes/compressor)** turns loud parts down so the level stays even.
- **[Noise Gate](/wiki/nodes/noise-gate)** silences the signal when it falls below a threshold.
- **[Limiter](/wiki/nodes/limiter)** stops peaks from ever going over a ceiling.
- **[Sidechain](/wiki/nodes/sidechain)** lets the Compressor or the Noise Gate react to a different signal than the one it changes, for ducking and keyed gating.

Their graphs are live while a pipeline runs: a green line shows the level the detector hears right now, and the point on the curve shows what comes out.

## Tone and cleanup

- **EQ**: 10-band graphic EQ at octave centres from 32 Hz to 16 kHz.
- **Noise Suppressor**: neural speech denoising (DeepFilterNet).
- **De-esser**: compresses only the harsh "s" band above a frequency you set.
- **Declick**: repairs short clicks and crackle.

## Space and colour

- **Delay**, **Reverb** and **Saturator** add echoes, room and warmth.
- **Plugin** hosts your own CLAP plugins as a node.

## Monitoring

Monitor nodes measure audio without changing it. Put one anywhere in a chain, or on a branch of its own.

- **Level Meter**: live peak and RMS for every channel, with peak hold and clip lamps. Click it to reset the peaks.
- **[Loudness](/wiki/nodes/loudness)**: EBU R128 loudness in LUFS, true peak, loudness range and delivery checks.
- **Waveform**: a live min/max envelope for each channel.
- **Spectrum**: a log-frequency spectrum with peak hold.

## Control

Control nodes carry on/off signals instead of audio. See [Control and routing nodes](/wiki/nodes/control).
